WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:14.750
Hey it's Joey and welcome to Better Ideas.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.620
Now a lot of people in this highly digital
social media-driven society are finding it

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.840
increasingly difficult to get work done without
getting distracted by the social media.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:26.590
I've experienced the same problem whether
it's endlessly scrolling through the newsfeed

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.490
on Facebook, hitting that discover tab on
Instagram - just constantly refreshing it,

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.420
or just binge-watching YouTube videos.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.860
But I've been fortunate enough to stumble
upon four awesome tips that have really helped

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:41.861
me increase my productivity, decrease the
amount of time I waste on the internet and

00:00:41.861 --> 00:00:46.300
social media in general - all without compromising
my ability to be reached by other people.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:50.010
Number one: install the News Feed Erradicator
Chrome extension.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.210
News Feed Eradicator is a free extension that
blocks your Facebook News Feed and replaces

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:59.170
it with a motivational quote.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:03.970
You can still access messenger and view notifications,
but it stops you from endlessly scrolling

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:05.940
which is the main problem we're trying to
avoid here.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:09.350
This is definitely one of the best and most
easily implemented strategies to help you

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.240
stop mindlessly scrolling through the Facebook
news feed.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.330
Number Two is delete the Facebook app off
your phone and replace it with the Messenger

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.330
app.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.330
This is helpful for the exact same reason
that my first tip was helpful - it keeps you

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.680
away from the News Feed.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.560
The News Feed is bad news.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:28.850
Why do you need to know what meme Johny Smith
tagged Suzie Q in two hours ago?

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:29.850
It's useless.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:30.850
It's crap!

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:35.220
Stop wasting time on useless unsubstantial
things and start getting good, meaningful

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.220
work done.

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.440
Number four is install the Forest app on your
phone.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:43.220
There are a million videos explaining what
the Forest app is and it has millions of downloads,

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.090
basically, I'll just put the link in the description
and you can check that out.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:52.090
My fourth and final tip is possibly the most
practical and the most important: Don't use

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.370
social media first thing in the morning.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:58.010
Try having a one hour period in the morning
where you don't check social media, don't

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.940
look at the internet - and just dedicate it
to starting the day off right.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:06.140
Maybe eat a good breakfast, take a shower,
get dressed into something fly, and then make

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.670
a to-do list for the day or read a book.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:12.230
Starting the day off right by doing something
productive will set the tone for the entire

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.370
rest of the day.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:17.920
Studies have shown that willpower is a finite
resource that depletes throughout the day

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.209
the more decisions you make.

00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:22.209
Which means that in the morning, when you
haven't made any decisions at all, make the

00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:26.970
right decision - to do work - and use that
tremendous amount of willpower you have to

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:28.770
get important things done.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:32.810
If you follow these four tips, you have my
personal guarantee that social media and the

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:36.999
internet will start becoming less of a problem
in your life and you'll get a lot more work

00:02:36.999 --> 00:02:38.159
done.

